=== CO SO LY THUYET: ORACLE DOC LAP & KIEM THU TO HOP (COMBINATORIAL TESTING) ===

1. KHAI NIEM VA VAI TRO CUA TEST ORACLE DOC LAP:
   - Test Oracle la co che xac dinh lieu mot ca kiem thu la PASS hay FAIL (so sanh ket qua thuc te voi ket qua mong doi).
   - SAI LAM NGUY HIEM: Dung chinh ma nguon cua he thong (hoac output chay lan dau) lam oracle. Neu ma nguon co bug,
     oracle bi nhiem loi va se xac nhan bug do la dung (False Positive / False Negative) - day la loi 'Kiem thu chuong trinh bang chinh no'.
   - NGUYEN TAC ORACLE DOC LAP:
     Trong Lab 7, ham expected_status() duoc viet doc lap bang Python hoan toan dua tren tai lieu dac ta yeu cau (Software Requirement Specification).
     Ngon ngu lap trinh khac (Python vs C), cau truc ma khac, tu duy khac giup phat hien bat ky su sai lech nao cua code C.

2. PHAN HOACH LOP TUONG DUONG VA KIEM THU GIA TRI BIEN:
   - Khong gian dau vao la vo han (quantity tu INT_MIN den INT_MAX, price la so thuc).
   - Equivalence Partitioning chia khong gian thanh cac mien gia tri co cung hanh vi.
   - Boundary Value Analysis (BVA) tap trung kiem thu tai cac diem ranh gioi (0, 1, 9, 10, 19, 20, 100, 101),
     noi co xac suat mac loi off-by-one cao nhat.

3. GIA TRI CUA COMBINATORIAL BRANCH TESTING TRONG AN TOAN PHAN MEM:
   - Cac lo hong bao mat thuong an nau tai su ket hop hiem gap giua cac tham so (vi du: don hang khong phai thanh vien nhung gia tri lon).
   - Kiem thu to hop dam bao khong bo sot bat ky nga re nao cua luong dieu khien (Control Flow Graph).